<title>UK: IMI to close UK unit, take 25 mln stg charge.</title>
<headline>IMI to close UK unit, take 25 mln stg charge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group IMI Plc said on Thursday it planned to close its IMI Yorkshire Alloys Ltd unit and take a related provision of 25 million stg in its 1996 accounts.</p>
</text>
